{
  "name": "Quickened Spell",
  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>When you cast a spell that has a casting time of an Action, you can spend 2 Sorcery Points to change the casting time to a Bonus Action for this casting. You can't modify a spell in this way if you've already cast a level 1+ spell on the current turn, nor can you cast a level 1+ spell on this turn after modifying a spell in this way.</p>",
